  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "编译期分工",
      "items": [
        "ButterKnifeProcessor 在 process 里先 findAndParseTargets 收集，再对每个 BindingSet 调 brewJava 写盘",
        "生成类名为「目标类全名 + _ViewBinding」，实现 Unbinder 并提供 (Target, View) 构造器"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "运行期只有一次反射",
      "items": [
        "ButterKnife.bind 用 ClassLoader 加载 Xxx_ViewBinding，取构造器后 newInstance，结果缓存在 BINDINGS",
        "找不到绑定类时向父类递归查找，遇到 android./java./androidx. 前缀立即放弃并返回 Unbinder.EMPTY"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "监听器元数据",
      "items": [
        "ListenerClass 描述 setter/remover/targetType，ListenerMethod 描述回调方法签名，二者驱动代码生成",
        "@OnClick 生成匿名 DebouncingOnClickListener，unbind 时按 remover 把监听器摘掉"
      ]
    }
  ]
}